  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\int \\frac{\\log _e\\left(x+\\sqrt{\\left.1+x^2\\right)}\\right.}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}} d x=f(g(x))+c$ then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WoAjn",
      "text": "$f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{2}, g(x)=\\log _e\\left(x+\\sqrt{1+x^2}\\right)$",
